<title>MOROCCO: Morocco seeks soft wheat for December delivery.</title>
<headline>Morocco seeks soft wheat for December delivery.</headline>
<dateline>RABAT 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morocco will launch on Friday a tender to buy 10,000 tonnes optional soft wheat for December delivery, an official at the state-owned Office Interprofessionnel des Cereales et Legumineuses (ONICL) said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>He said it will be delivered on December 1-10 at the northern port of Nador.</p>
